{"strongs": "H3898", "word": "לָחַם", "translit": "la.cham", "root": "לחם", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "fight, do battle", "definition": "I. [ לָחַם ] 171 verb fight, do battle (Late Hebrew Hithpa`el; ואלתחם MI 11.15.19 perhaps = order the battle , compare Nö ZMG xl. 1886, 721 ; Arabic fit close together , so Late Hebrew לחם Pi`el, Syriac Pa`el unite , fit also threaten ; Gerber Verb. Denom. 59 thinks verb in Hebrew denominative from מִלְחָמָה battle-line , but dubious); — Qal (poetry) only Imperative masculine singular and Participle active — fight, do battle with, rare, only Psalms, apparently later usage: — לְחַם אֶתלֹֿחֲמָ֑י Ps 35:1 do battle with those battling with me (dubious whether את is accusative sign compare preposition with , compare Ol ; || רִיבָה אֶתיְֿרִיבַי ); לֹחֲמִים לִי Ps 56:3 doing battle against me ; לֹחֵם v Ps 56:2 as substantive fighter. Niph`al 167 Perfect נִלְחַם Judg 9:17 +, וְנִלְחַמְתָּ֫ Judg 11:8 ; 1Sam 15:18 , וְנִלְחַמְנוּ Deut 1:41 consecutive, etc.; Imperfect יִלָּהֵם Exod 14:14 ; Deut 1:30 יִלָּ֫חֶם לָ֑נוּ Neh 4:14 , וַיִּלָּ֫חֶם Exod 17:8 + 19 t.; 3 feminine singular תִּלָּחֵם Zech 14:14 3 masculine plural תִּיִּלָּֽחֲמוּ Judg 1:5 + 13 t.; suffix וַיִּלָּֽחֲמוּנִי Ps 109:3 2 masculine plural תִּלָּֽחֲמוּ 1Kgs 22:31 + 4 t.; תִּלָּֽחֲמוּן 1Kgs 12:24 .; etc.; Imperative הִלָּחֵם Exod 17:9 ; 1Sam 18:17 הִלָּ֫חֶם בּוֺ Judg 9:38 plural הִלָּֽחֲמוּ 2Kgs 10:3 ; Neh 4:8 Infinitive absolute נִלְחֹם Judg 11:25 construct הִלָּחֵם Judg 1:9 + 35 t.; הִלָּ֫חֶם בּוֺ etc., Num 22:11 + 6 t.; suffix הִלָּחֲמוֺ 2Kgs 8:29 + 3 t.; Participle נִלְחָם Exod 14:24 + 10 t.; plural נִלְחָמִים Josh 10:25 + 10 t. (but 1Sam 31:1 read rather נִלְחֲמוּ , so || 1Chr 10:1 We Klo Bu , compare Dr ); — engage in battle (reciprocal), sometimes wage war ( Josh 10:5 ; Judg 11:5 ; 1Kgs 14:19 ; 1Kgs 22:46 ; 2Kgs 6:8 ; 2Kgs 14:28 etc.), often with בְּ of enemy (60 t.) Exod 1:10 ; Exod 17:9 ; Exod 17:10 ; Num 21:23 ; Num 21:26 ; Num 22:11 (all E ), Judg 11:8 ; Judg 11:25 ; 1Sam 15:18 ; 2Sam 8:10 + (49 t.); less often with בְּ of city attacked or besieged Judg 9:45 ; 1Sam 23:1 ; 2Sam 12:26 ; 2Sam 12:27 ; 2Sam 12:29 ; Isa 20:1 ; Josh 10:31 ( D ), 1Kgs 20:1 ; Neh 4:2 of tower Judg 1:52 followed by בְּאַרְצִי Judg 11:12 ; also with עִם of enemy (26 t.): Judg 5:20 ; Judg 11:4 ; Judg 11:5 ; Judg 11:20 ; Josh 11:5 ( J E ), 1Sam 13:5 ; 1Sam 17:19 , also 1Sam 17:32 ; 1Sam 17:33 (of single combat), Deut 20:4 ; Josh 9:2 (both D ), 2Kgs 13:12 ; 2Kgs 14:15 ; 2Chr 11:1 ; 2Chr 17:10 ; 2Chr 27:5 ; Dan 10:20 ; Dan 11:11 +; with עִם of city Josh 10:29 ( D ), Josh 19:47 ( J E ); c אֶתֿ = with , of enemy, Josh 24:8 ( E ), 1Sam 17:9 (single combat), Jer 21:5 ; 1Kgs 20:23 ; 2Kgs 19:9 = Isa 37:9 ; Jer 37:10 also Judg 12:4 ; 2Sam 11:17 ; 2Sam 21:15 ; 1Kgs 22:31 ; 2Kgs 8:2 ; 2Kgs 9:15 ; Jer 21:4 ; Jer 32:5 ; Jer 33:5 ; 2Chr 18:30 ; 2Chr 22:6 , and with אוֺתָם (= אִתָּם ) Josh 10:25 ( D ), 1Kgs 20:25 ( Kö Lgb. ii, 296 ); with עִל , against , of enemy only Jer 21:2 elsewhere (16 t.) of city: Josh 10:5 ( J E ), Isa 7:1 ; 2Kgs 12:18 ; 2Kgs 19:8 = Isa 37:8 especially D and Je: Deut 20:10 ; Deut 20:19 ; Josh 10:34 ; Josh 10:36 ; Josh 10:38 (all D ), Jer 32:24 ; Jer 32:29 ; Jer 34:1 ; Jer 34:7 ; Jer 34:8 ; Jer 34:22 ; with אֶלֿ of enemy Jer 1:19 ; Jer 15:20 ; with suffix וַיִּלָּֽחֲמוּנִי Ps 109:3 and they have fought against me ; with יָ֑חַד i.e. fight together = with (against) one another 1Sam 17:10 absolute with accusative of congnate meaning with verb מִלְחָמוֺת fight battles 1Sam 8:20 ; 1Sam 18:17 ; 1Sam 25:28 ; 2Chr 32:8 ; absolute elsewhere Judg 5:19 (twice in verse); Judg 5:20 ; Deut 1:41 ; Zech 10:5 + 26 t. + וַיָּסֻרוּ עָלָיו לְהִלָּחֵ֑ם 1Kgs 22:32 with עַל for, in behalf of , Judg 9:17 ; 2Kgs 10:3 ; Neh 4:8 with לְ = id ., Exod 14:14 ( J ), v Exod 14:25 ( J ; + בְּ of enemy), Deut 1:30 ; Deut 3:22 ; Deut 20:4 (+ עִם of enemy, see above), Josh 10:14 ; Josh 10:42 ; Josh 23:3 ; Josh 23:10 (all D ), Neh 4:14 ׳ יָכֹל לְהִלּ be able to fight , with את of enemy 1Sam 17:9 , with בְּ of enemy Num 22:11 , = be successful in fighting , prevail against; so with עַל of city Isa 7:1 , and absolute 2Kgs 16:5 (after וַיָּצֻרוּ עָל besiege ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4391')\">BDB4391</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3898')\">H3898</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4390')\">BDB4390</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4392')\">BDB4392</entry></div><p> I. [<bdbheb>לָחַם</bdbheb>]<sub>171</sub> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>fight, do battle</highlightword> (Late Hebrew Hithpa`el; <bdbheb>ואלתחם</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MI')\"><reflink>MI</reflink><sup>11.15.19</sup></lookup> perhaps = <highlight>order the battle</highlight>, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Nö')\">Nö<sup>ZMG xl. 1886, 721</sup></lookup>; Arabic <placeholder2804/> <highlight>fit close together</highlight>, so Late Hebrew <bdbheb>לחם</bdbheb> Pi`el, Syriac <placeholder2805/> Pa`el <highlight>unite</highlight>, <placeholder2806/> <highlight>fit</highlight> also <highlight>threaten</highlight>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gerber')\">Gerber<sup>Verb. Denom. 59</sup></lookup> thinks verb in Hebrew denominative from <bdbheb>מִלְחָמָה</bdbheb> <highlight>battle-line</highlight>, but dubious); — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> (poetry) only <highlight>Imperative</highlight> masculine singular and <highlight>Participle active — fight, do battle</highlight> with, rare, only Psalms, apparently later usage: — <bdbheb>לְחַם אֶתלֹֿחֲמָ֑י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 35:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,35,1)\">Ps 35:1</ref> <highlight>do battle with those battling with me</highlight> (dubious whether <bdbheb>את</bdbheb> is accusative sign compare preposition <highlight>with</highlight>, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ol')\">Ol</lookup>; || <bdbheb>רִיבָה אֶתיְֿרִיבַי</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>לֹחֲמִים לִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 56:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"56\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"56\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,56,3)\">Ps 56:3</ref> <highlight>doing battle against me</highlight>; <bdbheb>לֹחֵם</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Ps 56:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"56\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"56\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,56,2)\">Ps 56:2</ref> as substantive <highlight>fighter.</highlight> <b>Niph`al</b><sub>167</sub> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>נִלְחַם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 9:17\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(7,9,17)\">Judg 9:17</ref> +, <bdbheb>וְנִלְחַמְתָּ֫</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 11:8\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(7,11,8)\">Judg 11:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 15:18\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(9,15,18)\">1Sam 15:18</ref>, <bdbheb>וְנִלְחַמְנוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 1:41\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(5,1,41)\">Deut 1:41</ref> consecutive, etc.; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יִלָּהֵם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 14:14\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(2,14,14)\">Exod 14:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 1:30\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(5,1,30)\">Deut 1:30</ref> <bdbheb>יִלָּ֫חֶם לָ֑נוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 4:14\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(16,4,14)\">Neh 4:14</ref>, <bdbheb>וַיִּלָּ֫חֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 17:8\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(2,17,8)\">Exod 17:8</ref> + 19 t.; 3 feminine singular <bdbheb>תִּלָּחֵם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zech 14:14\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(38,14,14)\">Zech 14:14</ref> 3 masculine plural <bdbheb>תִּיִּלָּֽחֲמוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 1:5\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(7,1,5)\">Judg 1:5</ref> + 13 t.; suffix <bdbheb>וַיִּלָּֽחֲמוּנִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 109:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"109\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"109\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,109,3)\">Ps 109:3</ref> 2 masculine plural <bdbheb>תִּלָּֽחֲמוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 22:31\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(11,22,31)\">1Kgs 22:31</ref> + 4 t.; <bdbheb>תִּלָּֽחֲמוּן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 12:24\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(11,12,24)\">1Kgs 12:24</ref>.; etc.; <highlight>Imperative</highlight> <bdbheb>הִלָּחֵם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 17:9\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(2,17,9)\">Exod 17:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 18:17\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(9,18,17)\">1Sam 18:17</ref> <bdbheb>הִלָּ֫חֶם בּוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 9:38\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(7,9,38)\">Judg 9:38</ref> plural <bdbheb>הִלָּֽחֲמוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 10:3\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(12,10,3)\">2Kgs 10:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 4:8\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(16,4,8)\">Neh 4:8</ref> <highlight>Infinitive absolute</highlight> <bdbheb>נִלְחֹם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 11:25\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(7,11,25)\">Judg 11:25</ref> <highlight>construct</highlight> <bdbheb>הִלָּחֵם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 1:9\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(7,1,9)\">Judg 1:9</ref> + 35 t.; <bdbheb>הִלָּ֫חֶם בּוֺ</bdbheb> etc., <ref ref=\"Num 22:11\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(4,22,11)\">Num 22:11</ref> + 6 t.; suffix <bdbheb>הִלָּחֲמוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 8:29\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(12,8,29)\">2Kgs 8:29</ref> + 3 t.; <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>נִלְחָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 14:24\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(2,14,24)\">Exod 14:24</ref> + 10 t.; plural <bdbheb>נִלְחָמִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 10:25\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(6,10,25)\">Josh 10:25</ref> + 10 t. (but <ref ref=\"1Sam 31:1\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(9,31,1)\">1Sam 31:1</ref> read rather <bdbheb>נִלְחֲמוּ</bdbheb>, so || <ref ref=\"1Chr 10:1\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(13,10,1)\">1Chr 10:1</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Klo')\">Klo</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bu')\">Bu</lookup>, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup>); — <highlight>engage in battle</highlight> (reciprocal), sometimes <highlight>wage war</highlight> (<ref ref=\"Josh 10:5\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(6,10,5)\">Josh 10:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 11:5\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(7,11,5)\">Judg 11:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 14:19\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(11,14,19)\">1Kgs 14:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 22:46\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"46\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"46\" onclick=\"bcv(11,22,46)\">1Kgs 22:46</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 6:8\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(12,6,8)\">2Kgs 6:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 14:28\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(12,14,28)\">2Kgs 14:28</ref> etc.), often with <bdbheb>בְּ</bdbheb> of enemy (60 t.) <ref ref=\"Exod 1:10\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(2,1,10)\">Exod 1:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 17:9\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(2,17,9)\">Exod 17:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 17:10\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(2,17,10)\">Exod 17:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 21:23\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(4,21,23)\">Num 21:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 21:26\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(4,21,26)\">Num 21:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 22:11\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(4,22,11)\">Num 22:11</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Judg 11:8\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(7,11,8)\">Judg 11:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 11:25\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(7,11,25)\">Judg 11:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 15:18\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(9,15,18)\">1Sam 15:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 8:10\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(10,8,10)\">2Sam 8:10</ref> + (49 t.); less often with <bdbheb>בְּ</bdbheb> of city attacked or besieged <ref ref=\"Judg 9:45\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"45\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"45\" onclick=\"bcv(7,9,45)\">Judg 9:45</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 23:1\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(9,23,1)\">1Sam 23:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 12:26\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(10,12,26)\">2Sam 12:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 12:27\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(10,12,27)\">2Sam 12:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 12:29\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(10,12,29)\">2Sam 12:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 20:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,20,1)\">Isa 20:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 10:31\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(6,10,31)\">Josh 10:31</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('D')\"><reflink>D</reflink></